# CONFIG's Basic Tuning for a copter, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigSimplePids.cs
# (PLAN.md §13.6 row 92).
#
# SoftwareConfig adds ConfigSimplePids as "Basic Tuning", and opens on it, when the vehicle is an
# ArduCopter and the display view shows Basic Tuning (SoftwareConfig.cs:160-165). Activate reads
# acsimplepids.xml and makes a RangeControl for each of its six items the vehicle has a parameter
# for (ConfigSimplePids.cs:26-36, 128-154); a copter of today has only ATC_RAT_RLL_P of the six,
# so one control shows: "Roll/Pitch Sensitivity:", the number with the documented range's ends
# under the bar, green inside the range.
#
# A change writes the parameter and then its three relations - ATC_RAT_RLL_I, ATC_RAT_PIT_P and
# ATC_RAT_PIT_I at the same value (acsimplepids.xml, ConfigSimplePids.cs:172-209) - and TXT_info
# lists each as "set NAME VALUE". The arrow steps by the documented increment, 0.005. On SITL the
# four start equal (0.135), so the step down puts all four back.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-simple-pids.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 6
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

# CONFIG lists the tuning pages once every parameter is in (SoftwareConfig.cs:148-150), and here
# parameters are downloaded when asked for.
click param-download
settle 15
expect params.held > 1000
# The count passes before the last parameters land.
settle 5
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.135
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.135

click tab-config
settle 1
expect screen config
expect config.page ConfigSimplePids
expect config.title Basic Tuning
expect config.simplepids.active true
expect config.simplepids.items ATC_RAT_RLL_P
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.1350
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.title Roll/Pitch Sensitivity:
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.min 0.01
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.max 0.5
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.decimals 4
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.track 255
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.colour green
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.relations ATC_RAT_RLL_I*1,ATC_RAT_PIT_P*1,ATC_RAT_PIT_I*1
expect config.simplepids.info NOTE: using this interface may reset some off your custom pids.
expect config.simplepids.last none

# The up arrow: one increment, written at once with the three relations, each listed.
click simplepids-ATC_RAT_RLL_P-up
settle 3
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.1400
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.track 265
expect config.simplepids.last ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.14 accepted
expect config.simplepids.info set ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.14 | set ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.14 | set ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.14 | set ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.14
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.14
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.14

# Typed into and read on Enter: the value held to the range's maximum, no question asked.
click simplepids-ATC_RAT_RLL_P
expect config.simplepids.editing ATC_RAT_RLL_P
key ctrl+u
type 9
key Return
settle 3
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.5000
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.track 1000
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.colour green
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.5

# Put back by typing: all four at 0.135 again.
click simplepids-ATC_RAT_RLL_P
key ctrl+u
type 0.135
key Return
settle 3
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.1350
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P.track 255
expect config.simplepids.last ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.135 accepted
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.135
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.135
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.135
expect params.value.ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.135

# Another page and back: Activate makes the controls afresh at the vehicle's values. TXT_info is
# not in panel1, so Activate leaves it (ConfigSimplePids.cs:25-36): the set lines stay.
click config-page-ConfigUserDefined
settle 1
expect config.simplepids.active false
click config-page-ConfigSimplePids
settle 1
expect config.simplepids.active true
expect config.simplepids.ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.1350
expect config.simplepids.info set ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.135 | set ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.135 | set ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.135 | set ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.135
